OL,3,GNEWSANepal communities left traumatised
OL,4,Aby floods, says expat
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Solihullb@Qborn woman living in Nepal
OL,7,Fsaid the scale of destruction caused by
OL,8,Fthe landslides and flash floods on the
OL,9,FNepal-Tibet border is "almost
OL,10,Fimpossible to comprehend".
OL,12,FAt least 1,200 people have died and
OL,13,Fthousands more remain missing after a
OL,14,F"glacial collapse" high in the
OL,15,FHimalayas, led to floodwater and debris
OL,16,Fsweeping through towns and villages.
OL,18,FClaire Tamang, who has lived in
OL,19,FKathmandu since 2010, said the disaster
OL,20,Fhas left communities "traumatised".
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
