OL,3,GNEWSANepal communities left traumatised
OL,4,Aby floods, says expat
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe expat said products coming in and
OL,7,Fout of the country have been disrupted,
OL,8,Fwith food prices rising and electricity
OL,9,Finterrupted due to hydropower plants
OL,10,Fbeing destroyed in the floods.
